OL,3,GNEWSAMP to use Mail on Sunday libel
OL,4,Apayout for law award
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP who was falsely accused by the
OL,7,FMail on Sunday of hiding a private
OL,8,Feducation has said she is using her
OL,9,Flibel settlement to support first-year
OL,10,Flaw students who attended state
OL,11,Fschools.
OL,13,FCatherine Atkinson, who represents
OL,14,FDerby North, was paid damages and costs
OL,15,Fafter an article in an early edition
OL,16,Fwrongly claimed that she attended a
OL,17,Fprivate school.
OL,19,FAssociated Newspapers, the newspaper's
OL,20,Fpublisher, corrected later editions and
OL,21,Fpublished an apology.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
