OL,3,GNEWSAMP to use Mail on Sunday libel
OL,4,Apayout for law award
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour MP, who was state-educated
OL,7,Fand worked as a barrister for 17 years,
OL,8,Fis donating at least #5,000 from the
OL,9,Fsettlement towards the Catherine
OL,10,FAtkinson Future Lawyers Award, which
OL,11,Fshe is establishing with the University
OL,12,Fof Derby.
